Package: AAbAtlas
Type: Package
Title: Access the Antibodyome Atlas of Autoantibody Profiling Datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alexandre", "Marques", email = "marquesufcg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Client for the antibodyome-atlas, a curated catalog of
    autoantibody profiling datasets and papers (protein/antigen microarrays
    and related platforms) drawn from public repositories such as GEO and
    ArrayExpress. Metadata is fetched live from the atlas's GitHub-hosted
    JSON manifest, so results always reflect the latest curated data (or a
    pinned release, for reproducibility). Provides functions to list and
    filter datasets, resolve citations and related records, and download
    the underlying data files.
